{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:765","content":{"id":765,"title":"搜索","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持两种搜索模式：全文搜索和 AI 搜索。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可点击右上角的搜索按钮或者通过 "},{"type":"kbd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Ctrl/Command + K"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 打开搜索面板，目前的搜索范围包括「卡片、文章、项目文档、知识库文档和日记」，在进行搜索会同时使用两种搜索。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0235ea42-b5a2-4ded-9df4-07381eadf9db.webp","alt":"","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0235ea42-b5a2-4ded-9df4-07381eadf9db.webp","width":681},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"全文搜索默认启用，并且对数据库中的内容会在打开软件时默认进行索引，而 AI 搜索需要先将文档向量化，通过向量数据库进行相似度检索。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向量化方式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"软件支持两种向量化方式。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地向量化"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用本地嵌入模型进行向量化，无需调用外部 API，完全离线运行，不产生额外费用。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_af407128-6fdf-43b4-8009-3f17ea784e66.webp","uuid":"6ca0a74f-6407-47c0-99a8-3f71445affbd","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_af407128-6fdf-43b4-8009-3f17ea784e66.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在设置中选择「本地向量化」后，软件会自动下载并加载嵌入模型。首次使用时需要下载模型文件，之后即可离线使用。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在下方还有一些增强检索能力的本地模型可以按需使用："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Query Expander：对用户的检索输入进行扩展以检索到更多结果"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Reranker：对检索到的结果进行排序，将和用户检索输入最相关放到前面"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经过我的使用，我发现开启这两个之后并没有对检索能力有显著提升，反而因为这两个过程非常耗时，反而影响检索体验，因此我建议将这两个关闭。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"优点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"完全免费，无 API 调用费用"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据隐私性更好，不需要将内容发送到外部服务"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无网络依赖，离线可用"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首次下载模型需要一定时间和存储空间"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向量化速度相对较慢（取决于设备性能）"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向量质量可能不如大型商业模型"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"API 向量化"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过调用外部 API 进行向量化，支持 OpenAI 兼容的 API（目前的主流模型基本都支持）。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_44b129e5-021f-4bce-b172-8cbd8dd9e1c1.webp","uuid":"516626b0-af66-47ae-9713-ae85063ebc55","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_44b129e5-021f-4bce-b172-8cbd8dd9e1c1.webp","width":720},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_771bf3e3-056f-45de-97dd-83cef5f8c94d.webp","uuid":"f481ad41-9526-4158-98af-f929b06d7273","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_771bf3e3-056f-45de-97dd-83cef5f8c94d.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"优点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向量化速度快"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向量质量通常更好，检索准确度更高"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不占用本地计算资源"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要配置 API 密钥"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产生 API 调用费用"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要网络连接"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据会发送到外部服务"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向量化配置"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在设置模型时需要设置向量长度和距离阈值："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向量长度","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：由于不同的模型其生成的向量长度不同，而且同一模型也支持生成不同的向量长度，无法事先确定，因此需要根据文档设置"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地向量化：软件会自动识别模型的向量长度，无需手动配置"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"API 向量化：需要根据所选模型的文档手动设置向量长度"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"},{"type":"formatted","text":"如果要改变嵌入模型，之前的已向量化的数据就完全没有作用，软件会将之前的数据删除，并创建一个新的数据库表","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"距离阈值","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：我们会根据搜索词和已有向量化的文档进行相似度计算，范围在 [0, 1] 之间，距离越小表示越相关，只有小于阈值的文档我们才会认为是相关的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"阈值越小：检索到的文档越少，相关性越强，但可能产生遗漏"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"阈值越大：检索到的文档越多，但可能包含不太相关的文档"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同模型的最佳阈值不同，需要根据实际体验和个人偏好调整"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考值："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地向量化模型：建议从 0.5 开始尝试"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"OpenAI text-embedding-3-large：0.6 是一个比较均衡的值"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","title":"警告","calloutType":"warning","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"表单中「支持的特性」这一部分可忽略，这部分功能暂未实现，未来不仅能搜索文档，还能进一步搜索图片、音视频等资源，这部分取决于模型能力。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向量化操作"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于使用 API 向量化会产生费用（API 向量化），因此不会自动进行向量化，需要在索引数据库中手动进行向量化，只有向量化后才能被 AI 搜索检索到。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_017a8945-9dc7-46e2-9091-1313b2ffd147.webp","alt":"","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_017a8945-9dc7-46e2-9091-1313b2ffd147.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果是本地向量化，那么这个过程是自动的，只要发现文档有更新，就会自动进行向量化，如果在本地电脑性能尚可的情况下，强烈建议使用本地向量化。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"highlight-block","title":"技巧","calloutType":"tip","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"AI 搜索支持语义搜索，而不仅仅是关键词搜索，这意味你可以使用自然语言直接进行搜索，就像是让一个人去搜索一样，不用给出精准的关键字，并且准确度非常高，强烈建议配置！"}],"disableDrag":false}],"color":"green"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"高级功能","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:769","type":"doc","id":769}},{"label":"搜索","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:765","type":"doc","id":765}}],"prevPage":{"title":"高级功能","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:769","type":"doc","id":769}},"nextPage":{"title":"同步","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:762","type":"doc","id":762}},"createTime":1767241042228,"updateTime":1777715045382,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777715045382}}